{
  "name": "personal-cloud-drive",
  "version": "1.3.19",
  "changelog": [
    "修复 AI 对话抽屉顶栏在显示返回/切全库按钮或窄屏拖拽时模型胶囊被截断遮挡的问题：引入容器宽度多档渐进自适应（@container ai-drawer），任意抽屉宽度与模式下均完整展示、零重叠零半截裁剪",
    "顺带修复从子文件夹切换回「AI全库问答」时推荐卡片文案仍显示子目录名及可能出现重复「整理结构」卡片的问题"
  ],
  "private": true,
  "description": "DPSir 个人私有智云盘 (Personal Cloud Drive) - 核心服务与依赖配置",
  "main": "server.js",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "node server.js",
    "start:watchdog": "node scripts/server-watchdog.js",
    "test:smoke": "node tests/smoke.js",
    "test:isolation": "node tests/test_avatar_isolation.js",
    "test:security": "node tests/test_password_and_recovery.js"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "archiver": "^7.0.1",
    "compression": "^1.8.1",
    "dompurify": "^3.1.6",
    "express": "^4.19.2",
    "fast-xml-parser": "^5.9.3",
    "jszip": "^3.10.1",
    "katex": "^0.16.11",
    "mammoth": "^1.12.0",
    "marked": "^12.0.2",
    "multer": "^2.2.0",
    "pdf-parse": "^1.1.1",
    "tesseract.js": "^5.1.1",
    "xlsx": "^0.18.5"
  }
}